    "title": "10 WSU basketball players officially in transfer portal - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Jamey Vinnick ,\n11 hours ago PULLMAN -- The men's basketball transfer portal officially opened on Tuesday at 9 p.m. Pacific, and all 1o of the Washington State players expected to officially enter the transfer are now indeed in. As Cougfan.com reported last week, Jerone Morton and Brunel Madzou were headed in, and according to verbalcommits.com both are now in the portal, with Morton penning a goodbye to WSU on social media. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak 1",
